<navigation-bar title="识别结果" back="{{false}}" color="#2d2623" background="transparent"><view slot="left" class="nav-circle" bindtap="goBack"><view class="back-icon"></view></view><view slot="right" class="retry-button" bindtap="retry"><view class="retry-icon"></view><text>重新识别</text></view></navigation-bar>
<scroll-view class="result-scroll" scroll-y enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="page-shell no-tabs result-page">
  <view class="food-card ui-card"><view class="meal-photo-wrap {{samplePhoto ? 'sample' : ''}}"><image class="meal-photo" src="{{photo}}" mode="{{samplePhoto ? 'heightFix' : 'aspectFill'}}"></image></view><view class="food-list"><text class="food-heading">识别到以下食物</text><view class="food-row" wx:for="{{foods}}" wx:key="name"><view class="food-dot {{item.tone}}">{{item.badge}}</view><text class="food-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="food-amount">{{item.amount}}</text></view><view class="reference-note"><view class="info-icon">i</view><text>识别结果仅供参考，可手动调整</text><view class="edit-icon" bindtap="editFood"></view></view></view></view>
  <view class="estimate-card ui-card"><view class="estimate-title"><text class="section-title">营养估算</text><view class="info-icon">i</view></view><view class="nutrition-grid"><view class="nutrition-cell" wx:for="{{nutrition}}" wx:key="name"><text class="nutrition-name">{{item.name}}</text><view class="nutrition-badge {{item.tone}}">{{item.badge}}</view><text class="nutrition-value">{{item.value}}</text></view></view><view class="estimate-foot"><text>* 估算值基于食材库和AI计算，仅供参考</text><view class="detail-inline"><text>查看营养详情</text><view class="chevron"></view></view></view></view>
  <view class="evaluation-card ui-card"><text class="evaluation-heading">AI营养评价（结合小米·10个月23天）</text><view class="evaluation-body"><image src="/assets/baby-eating-v2.jpg" mode="aspectFill"></image><view class="evaluation-panel"><view><text class="good-title">做得很棒</text><text>蛋白质来源丰富</text><text>蔬菜搭配合理</text><text>食材种类充足</text></view><view class="suggestion"><text class="suggestion-title">小建议</text><text>铁含量一般，建议下一餐增加红肉或动物肝脏，有助于铁的吸收。</text></view></view></view></view>
</view></scroll-view>
<view class="result-actions safe-fixed"><button class="secondary-button" bindtap="editFood">手动调整食材</button><button class="primary-button" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="save"><view wx:if="{{!saving}}" class="check-circle"><view class="check-icon"></view></view><text>{{saving ? '正在保存' : '保存到今日记录'}}</text></button></view>
